    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Destroy This Block' is a simple 2D puzzle game about guiding a bomb to the target block through restrictive paths and dangerous obstacles before time runs out. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The bomb's movement conserves momentum in a zero gravity environment, making this highly challenging at times. Obstacles include:<br><br>- Moving or spinning blocks that need good timing to avoid<br>- Tight spaces requiring careful control to navigate<br>- Boost blocks that will throw you in a particular direction<br>- Gravity blocks that constantly pull you toward them<br><br>A DEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The full game has over 150 levels varying from very easy at levels 1-10 to almost impossible by the end. Most screenshots shown are for earlier levels as this game is still under development. Wishlists and demo downloads are much appreciated, as is any constructive feedback!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Destroy This Block' is a simple 2D puzzle game about guiding a bomb to the target block through restrictive paths and dangerous obstacles before time runs out. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/968413794b671fd485f8c1ce62a30183.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The bomb's movement conserves momentum in a zero gravity environment, making this highly challenging at times. Obstacles include:<br><br>- Moving or spinning blocks that need good timing to avoid<br>- Tight spaces requiring careful control to navigate<br>- Boost blocks that will throw you in a particular direction<br>- Gravity blocks that constantly pull you toward them<br><br>A DEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/1d327465f5a86d7978d01ca566897077.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The full game has over 150 levels varying from very easy at levels 1-10 to almost impossible by the end. Most screenshots shown are for earlier levels as this game is still under development. Wishlists and demo downloads are much appreciated, as is any constructive feedback!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.poster.avif?t=1752781975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.webm?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802180/extras/d1c5e1de04788f2f19f2b83b2ee6f36f.mp4?t=1752781975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></p>",
